# Existing home before new columns or sections

Before adding a database column or a listing/form section, search for an existing home.

Do not add a parallel store or a second UI block for the same fact. Extend the existing table or section. If nothing exists, say so in the change.

Misses this already caused: house rules (`house_rules` / `property_house_rules` vs a second QLD block) and bank details (`property_payout_details` vs payee columns on `properties`).
